# 15. Performance Requirements

## 15.1 Client Performance Targets
- Fast initial load.
- Battle scene transitions under 1 second.
- Stable FPS on modern browsers.
- Low memory spikes between hub and battle.

## 15.2 Backend Performance Targets
- Fast account load.
- Save writes under a few hundred milliseconds under normal load.
- Season reset jobs should run in batches if needed.

## 15.3 Scaling Assumptions
This is a seasonal browser game, so the biggest traffic spikes will likely happen:
- at season start,
- at season end,
- after content updates.

Architect the backend so seasonal bursts do not cause downtime.

